# Synology indexer artefacts, created on the NFS share
@eaDir/

# Docs that exist for the author, not for a stranger trying to run this.
# The rule: if a file does not help someone else get the project running, it
# stays out of the repo. These are still written and still rendered to local
# HTML -- local and untracked, not unwritten. planningDocs/ is above on the
# same reasoning.
DEPLOY.md
DESIGN.md

# Local doc tooling: renders the unpublished docs, not needed to run raDash
tools/
